<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Wood-Pinholes-4x5-Camera on Blog de Pocallum — camera &amp; action!</title><link>https://112books.github.io/blog.pocallum.cat/categories/wood-pinholes-4x5-camera/</link><description>Recent content in Wood-Pinholes-4x5-Camera on Blog de Pocallum — camera &amp; action!</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>ca</language><lastBuildDate>Tue, 29 Apr 2025 00:00:00 +0200</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://112books.github.io/blog.pocallum.cat/categories/wood-pinholes-4x5-camera/feed.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>2025-04-27 - Dia internacional de la fotografia estenopeica a la Nau Bostik</title><link>https://112books.github.io/blog.pocallum.cat/2025/04/29/2025-04-27-dia-internacional-de-la-fotografia-estenopeica-a-la-nau-bostik/</link><pubDate>Tue, 29 Apr 2025 00:00:00 +0200</pubDate><guid>https://112books.github.io/blog.pocallum.cat/2025/04/29/2025-04-27-dia-internacional-de-la-fotografia-estenopeica-a-la-nau-bostik/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://photos.app.goo.gl/FwUrYgubxs5MmhnJ7"&gt;&lt;img src="https://blog.pocallum.cat/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/2025-04-27-Wood-Pinhole-4x5-Foma100@50-wwpd25-0022-812x1024.jpg" alt=""&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Feu un clik a la imatge principal per veure el total de retrats estenopeics realitzats, n&amp;rsquo;hi ha 29!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;El Dia internacional de la fotografia estenopeica #WorldPinholeDay2015 enguany el vàrem celebrar novament a la &lt;a href="https://naubostik.com/"&gt;@naubostik&lt;/a&gt; de la Sagrera, a la ja emblemàtica &lt;a href="https://www.instagram.com/sala_basiana.espai_sagrerina/"&gt;Sala Basiana&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href="https://awpcp.org/"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href="https://quedeque.barcelona/agenda/worldwide-photography-pinhole-day"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href="https://naubostik.com/"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;. Tot i que alguns dels &lt;em&gt;freaks&lt;/em&gt; pinholeros habituals no van poder passar-hi, sí que un bon nombre de persones es van deixar enganyar per la màgia del forat, aprofitant el matí de sol, el vermut i la Samba que omplien d’alegria l’espai gràcies a un altre esdeveniment simultani.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Retrats estenopeics pel ‘Dia Mundial de la Fotografia Estenopeica 2025’</title><link>https://112books.github.io/blog.pocallum.cat/2025/04/12/retrats-estenopeics-pel-dia-mundial-de-la-fotografia-estenopeica-2025/</link><pubDate>Sat, 12 Apr 2025 00:00:00 +0200</pubDate><guid>https://112books.github.io/blog.pocallum.cat/2025/04/12/retrats-estenopeics-pel-dia-mundial-de-la-fotografia-estenopeica-2025/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://blog.pocallum.cat/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/cartell-pinhole-day-2025_1-887x1024.png" alt=""&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ja arriba el bon temps i això vol dir que els amants de la fotografia estenopeica sortim del cau. Un any més celebrem aquest gran dia dins la &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://naubostik.com/"&gt;Nau Bostik&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; amb tothom que vulgui practicar o aprendre aquest tipus de fotografia.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;L’organització és anàrquica, així ens agrada fer-ho! Però la jornada s’inicia oficialment a les &lt;strong&gt;11h del matí&lt;/strong&gt; a la &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.instagram.com/sala_basiana.espai_sagrerina/"&gt;Sala Basiana&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Qui vulgui podrà hidratar-se al bar i començar a fer les seves fotografies sense cap mena de lent. Des de &lt;a href="https://llumatics.com/"&gt;Llumàtics&lt;/a&gt;, deixarem algunes càmeres fetes a mà i a qui li calgui, l’ajudarem en tot el procés.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>2023-05-01 - Estenopeica 4x5" - Jimmy i Aureli</title><link>https://112books.github.io/blog.pocallum.cat/2023/05/01/2023-05-01-estenopeica-4x5-jimmy-i-aureli/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 May 2023 00:00:00 +0200</pubDate><guid>https://112books.github.io/blog.pocallum.cat/2023/05/01/2023-05-01-estenopeica-4x5-jimmy-i-aureli/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://photos.app.goo.gl/zVMQhCxwM4e6iUxn9"&gt;&lt;img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/1erV2yzfU1REia5UDDSvyixcq3UBaH9pj_YKd9XCr21J0-ZHDtKyyqK_THFjrT9BSR9aXks-cOkeAWL7wFyKlA2DOGhMNe2oeyO6bj821443yKnQArkUaIsp6YJlvE70BponhxObRCqVY-bRp3S2js3K1QY3WyudARSYfbMXsNSjhcaYyaEnhgRWrHvM09Ka7kBPmsEKJbLttGTb7SiOoz_ars5gEZVHGJRO3ECrhPSMpPOpy61z2E4L85bODWzLKFTaqwPrdfSPUP-o99LjaMtzNiOSBdVxzISm6dkRT0Bgnu6H1AZE8PaA0b_j8V0quU7V76cRc3fq2cr3hXoIzhROUM_HpRHLXhfjRtOSvt03sUaPgcrol1XsQhr0Q6AvAfios_dVAd-7l2OkKQwn5idOx8cjfEwdgJhfSZKDo4UO6pXhtpyQl7r-uoxXaopXToikd01eBMStSaq3Aouio3opiKPclyeobfHT1hp6TBp8m1xRROeXmZEN1uq3CiqCkDKHdXymptKPJFk1gp0PeJRRc_zgk9nXdCEq0ULJog-2XtHrFfb3SB56DRfwC2_fZ3r2EIdAzb4LGi7e-fBMkZ7VRcT0mJS4hDPdE3fKeg2tROCyQRh5zi77rh11tf46FyHt9etK1itbu39RJ2FOR2XxCYvMOjplNMlFG4rcobbzvl7AwoXcHA3OTHq3DgEubhlgYMOTbbC_cpXduInpI19ysWRmZ0uBH7V0TttRhnM46GDjKVJG3FN-n8Qwt2L7q0-iArXTytgjKTUbDR-5OuMrURGiA2F5aypOoUU5_5W4HaGPokPcM-xZo5tRdhXK71uQ2BKeva1he0BFCFAMTcc1tcF7EIw6KtbkYDn9KU-xkUn6FmazxRTGd_ZXj321lB1aflwYMOCnbCDGFU5myIve6pa_ZJ5ohE-0Zp9ni4deCQ=w1004-h1255-s-no?authuser=0" alt=""&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Avui he baixat a &lt;a href="https://llumatics.com/es/"&gt;Llumàtics&lt;/a&gt;, dins la Nau &lt;a href="https://naubostik.com/"&gt;Bostik&lt;/a&gt;, a cercar unes plaques que vaig deixar ahir secar al laboratori. La meva sorpresa ha estat molt gran quan l&amp;rsquo;Aureli (el millor!) m&amp;rsquo;ha presentat a aquest encantador personatge. Ell és en Jimmy i el podreu conèixer millor aquest divendres a la &lt;a href="https://naubostik.com/esdeveniment/jam-session/"&gt;Sala Basiana&lt;/a&gt;, dins la Nau Bostik.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>2023-04-30- Wordwide Photograny Pinhole Day 2023</title><link>https://112books.github.io/blog.pocallum.cat/2023/04/30/2023-04-30-wordwide-photograny-pinhole-day-2023/</link><pubDate>Sun, 30 Apr 2023 00:00:00 +0200</pubDate><guid>https://112books.github.io/blog.pocallum.cat/2023/04/30/2023-04-30-wordwide-photograny-pinhole-day-2023/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://photos.app.goo.gl/BxVQZxW3y3Q8VaKF8"&gt;&lt;img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/pw/AJFCJaXmL8BiNVvBwDHu8jV4_8YCm3OMVoclv2WjROSOD5F-Syt5y7NWFhGphYMoCYv9keWOufMYNS3jd6Dny08_yG_0jOFgimwt4gSMCcnzdlkcR-W7MJRRNGl3Kj5FtXT2t8H-RhkpJKBoYNPg5NoNrDeurA=w1879-h1130-s-no?authuser=0" alt=""&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Un any més s&amp;rsquo;ha celebrat el dia internacional de la fotografia estenopeica. Així que uns quants freakies hem ajuntat forces i hem fet les nostres fotografies. Aquí alguns dels resultats. Encara queda material per escanejar.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Barcelona Worldwide Pinhole Photography Day 2019</title><link>https://112books.github.io/blog.pocallum.cat/2019/04/29/barcelona-worldwide-pinhole-photography-day-2019/</link><pubDate>Mon, 29 Apr 2019 00:00:00 +0200</pubDate><guid>https://112books.github.io/blog.pocallum.cat/2019/04/29/barcelona-worldwide-pinhole-photography-day-2019/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://photos.app.goo.gl/FPs6AhCpxNxQX1Pc7"&gt;&lt;img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/wfGgpWk5YTxudlHPf3EBWQGkkKvOssJI1q03J7j2ggk1Ci5t8zyovn2RGB6S_uFnxqRzGq3iXVWpv_g-8IXK2_WwjDJepNfV1T_gII-UhM3CEZRBbv-kbkT0HBhpFwUTgnCL0E-m6Tn5GZL8BJ269jX4HvqZpA_KTzXwndH3aKZTRg1ltQanzn3PxHhA3tH2wKT6crEovCm--aqXiqOlgHFB-LoxylflMffCZ5pqPkZWKnZPUHQMwGizZFJKNLDhMZgVNlMzZhmwicvfJQ8Qbv5pcnSRYA3lmKB1mhAPnIl3nQylxXx0pi1AHVK9iHf_mfNKTURfpWD8FDZwPEQN-1DW-44ZDOd4ufSzity19g7gD7P0zRM8RZD315K2QuyFOC4sDfFJrf2eOabXt8T2MVK1UgO39-CAMrpKs6Qg9j9ddBruQpQt2LVDjgo5N0XeaazlrJLVY9vZhTq5ROhyb0sCMFf3VmneLf5w8t_M9khEMyf9xBnCqZupUhhZ9Ev6r4tFzt7vPT82W1vNid4Pf3b6KObS7vLGWyFril-d9r62IJ3t5hnBP9DIWa-ccaA31w0mhNS6bhcpBXrfd0C04MMmQogVUYwMoW5RCCiSWG0FUqmITTO-0GuK9Nt9uPMFQoB-agUR6rWtWHn7IyK1x1Z3AiW5gwzn=w992-h1239-no" alt=""&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Totes les plaques 4x5&amp;quot; que vaig disparar el passat diumenge a la &lt;a href="http://naubostik.com"&gt;Nau Bostik&lt;/a&gt; amb una càmera estenopèica, de fusta ben senzilla, tot celebrant el &lt;a href="https://pinholeday.org"&gt;Worldwide Pinhole Photography Day&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Com podreu observar hi ha una doble accidental.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Pinhole wood 4x5 - Jardins Costa i Llovera - 15-02-2029</title><link>https://112books.github.io/blog.pocallum.cat/2019/02/15/pinhole-wood-4x5-jardins-costa-i-llovera-15-02-2029/</link><pubDate>Fri, 15 Feb 2019 00:00:00 +0100</pubDate><guid>https://112books.github.io/blog.pocallum.cat/2019/02/15/pinhole-wood-4x5-jardins-costa-i-llovera-15-02-2029/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://photos.app.goo.gl/eonCR1M39yHzpyvG6"&gt;&lt;img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/6bfuQKWZdHQdYVE6Xk5I30LnBJYwmETW-tr5s-HacOKTYGiV-NUrrbMoHX3Fb7xStfpzZfpmw9Py1HMksCA6ScOWLZqhULjbKZktDE8eGo7FAKM7whSsuW4gnYEUfbdNrXNiB-cMXWYYLdMu_uPJSFD2u_LMbUGJSIYrjvekqWCmABkkk5QZocNZsvFcd1sCDs9EQ1raptNGu40mX9Msqyvm8cQrJnqswDhW6Tanqym31ehYK3OkktkWu47WnU86XVuPjQp0Kli8_gIeBT7bw5jK6i2yF6Y2ktQJnMQBWHAvwD3z58z42ZZyz2ANzcKk0MPzcr0ChqRxy4ZCmm0IjvRoF9GNZsv-tYU0LEXoP__-5Eh3SKOwSBZMMwTbZy7bBxKwA6gV4mHrhqwTjoqk_jt5HjOhpN-OyNa_Z17sjIVwjG3FY_tzkjTqFWflS69O3sTx2ViOEoRKhewwwtwk4WqkJ4dmcPGUIaEAPK3c8U3VfoKCVjoS_8_mKZ0qmFO8FSnsUoCLa_DZy4oyNMS6Syra5cKHXS_JvbuVSRS99CkuWb_0jUlv8XFlJKBR4V-Xc2dfpgs03q5nJe6XZwV6l1Lr12pLJ5FdKCyn4wtmdTFoRpPdHf_CZbiWuZe4WP-jO0_DihECiX-AS_Qj42zzJy8_ofRo3XrR=w992-h1239-no" alt=""&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>